sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client
    participant Coord as LeadNode (Coordinator Node A)
    participant StorageA as StorageEngine (Node A)
    participant Remote as GrpcRemote
    participant PeerB as Peer Node B
    participant StorageB as StorageEngine (Node B)

    Client->>Coord: RangeQuery(start_key, count)
    Note over Coord: External caller triggers scatter-gather

    Coord->>Coord: known_peer_addresses() (from vnodes' fingers & successors)
    Coord->>StorageA: range_scan(start_key, overscan)
    StorageA-->>Coord: local_entries

    par Fanout to Cluster Peers
        Coord->>Remote: range_query(Peer B, start_key, overscan, caller="__local__")
        Remote->>PeerB: /lead.Lead/RangeQuery(caller="__local__")
        Note over PeerB: Sentinel detected: local scan only (no recursive fanout)
        PeerB->>StorageB: range_scan(start_key, overscan)
        StorageB-->>PeerB: peer_b_entries
        PeerB-->>Remote: RangeResponse { entries: peer_b_entries, complete: true }
        Remote-->>Coord: peer_b_entries
    end

    Note over Coord: Merge, global Hilbert sort & deduplication
    Coord->>Coord: all_entries.extend(peer_b_entries)
    Coord->>Coord: sort_unstable_by(|(a, _), (b, _)| a.cmp(b))
    Coord->>Coord: dedup_by(|(a, _), (b, _)| a == b) & truncate to count

    Coord-->>Client: RangeResponse { entries: top_count, complete: true }
